ersal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Tatterchain.PNG\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Tatterchain.PNG/420px-Tatterchain.PNG\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"655\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Tatterchain.PNG 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>Wrap this around your hands to strike at the heart of Undead.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p>Unlike Unholy items, this item won't give you a negative level if you are Good aligned.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817231112\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.096 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.145 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3995/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33576/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10673/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n117.96%  148.166     58 Template:IO\n100.00%  125.603      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  125.603      1 -total\n 95.66%  120.155      1 Template:Named_Weapon\n 39.05%   49.048      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 38.32%  